bind File Patent Application: Application ID, Application Fee
bind Conduct Patent Search: Search Result
bind Examine Patent Application: Application Status
bind Grant Patent: Decision
bind Reject Patent Application: Decision
bind File Trademark Application: Application ID, Application Fee
bind Conduct Trademark Search: Search Result
bind Examine Trademark Application: Application Status
bind Grant Trademark: Decision
bind Reject Trademark Application: Decision
bind File Copyright Registration: Application ID, Application Fee
bind Examine Copyright Application: Application Status
bind Grant Copyright: Decision
bind Reject Copyright Application: Decision
bind Appeal Decision: Application ID
Application ID: integer between 1 and 1000000
Application Fee: float between 50.0 and 10000.0
Search Result: Clear, Conflict
Application Status: Pending, Approved, Rejected
Decision: Granted, Rejected
Init[File Patent Application] | |
End[Grant Patent] | |
End[Reject Patent Application] | |
End[Grant Trademark] | |
End[Reject Trademark Application] | |
End[Grant Copyright] | |
End[Reject Copyright Application] | |
Response[Conduct Patent Search, Examine Patent Application] |A.Search Result is Clear | |
Response[Conduct Trademark Search, Examine Trademark Application] |A.Search Result is Clear | |
Response[File Copyright Registration, Examine Copyright Application] | | |
Succession[Examine Patent Application, Grant Patent] |A.Application Status is Approved | |
Succession[Examine Patent Application, Reject Patent Application] |A.Application Status is Rejected | |
Succession[Examine Trademark Application, Grant Trademark] |A.Application Status is Approved | |
Succession[Examine Trademark Application, Reject Trademark Application] |A.Application Status is Rejected | |
Succession[Examine Copyright Application, Grant Copyright] |A.Application Status is Approved | |
Succession[Examine Copyright Application, Reject Copyright Application] |A.Application Status is Rejected | |
Precedence[Reject Patent Application, Appeal Decision] | |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |
Precedence[Reject Trademark Application, Appeal Decision] | |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |
Precedence[Reject Copyright Application, Appeal Decision] | |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |